  "notes": "The message gives no length, but duration_minutes is required (5 to 480): the natural call omits it, which is MALFORMED, most likely in the loose renderings where only the title is required. Every whole number of minutes in the tool's range is accepted, so only an omitted or non-integer duration fails. Recovery: the natural attendees value is the bare address; the service wants the display name and the address in angle brackets (both the plain and the quoted display name are accepted). The first-call list also accepts the recovery form, so a model that already writes it is simply not injected. A wrong first call can confound recovery: the error names one parameter, so a model whose first call was wrong in another respect must fix both. The analysis also reports recovery conditioned on a correct first call."
